OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy and generally dry through the
OL,7,Fevening, though some showers may
OL,8,Flinger in western and coastal parts.
OL,9,FThese mostly dying away in the early
OL,10,Fhours with clear spells developing.
OL,11,FWinds easing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FGenerally dry with good
OL,14,Fspells of sunshine, though there may
OL,15,Fbe some isolated showers. Winds
OL,16,Ffalling light away from the coast. Dry
OL,17,Fwith clear spells overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
