OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand breezy Thursday, with evening
OL,7,Frain. Early rain clearing, then mostly
OL,8,Fdry Friday with the odd shower
OL,9,Fpossible. Rain spreading in late on
OL,10,FSaturday. Temperatures around average.
